type: GenericCrafter
size: 2
name: Incineration Rig

description: "
Incinerates items rapidly
Produces slag as a byproduct

Cant melt any items that are 
unflammable
[green]
- Incinerates items
- produces slag[red]
- Explosive
- Cant incinerate items with 
flammability lower then 0
- requires power
"

category: production
requirements: [lead/175, copper/150, graphite/75, silicon/40, metaglass/40]
buildVisiblity: sandboxOnly
outputLiquid: slag/0.16667

ignoreLiquidFullness: true
baseExplosiveness: 75
craftTime: 5
consumes: {
power: 1.5
itemFlammable: {
minFlammability: 0
}
}

itemCapacity: 40
customShadow: true
drawer: [
{
type: DrawDefault
}
{
type: DrawGlowRegion
suffix: "-top"
color: f3e979
}
]
